/p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "9qfai3-dqlvYxS_rkzyeO", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 479466297, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 479466075, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p>Things you should include in your presentation:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The two parent animals;</li>\n<li>Which features of the new animal are inherited from which parent;</li>\n<li>How the new animal is better adapted than its parents to a particular situation, environment or purpose;</li>\n<li>Any ways in which the new animal might find it harder to survive than its parents;</li>\n<li>Why you chose to make this new animal.</li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "gXJvf7qvxGsntRKXnUI4d", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 479466526, "text": "Which animals should I cross?", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 479466476, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMA